    {
      "question": "Where does the case stand and what is outstanding?",
      "answer": "The oven job was wrongly closed and is now reopened, waiting for Lantern Works to book a visit. The roof leak is a new urgent job waiting for contractor assignment and landlord approval. The fence status and invoice issuer are unresolved."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the next action, recipient and channel?",
      "answer": "Email the tenant (A3) with the correction, email Lantern Works (A4) to book the visit and confirm the invoice issuer, and email the landlord (A5) about the reopen and the roof leak. Follow-ups are set for 2026-08-27 (A6, A7)."
    },
    {
      "question": "Does anything need a human decision?",
      "answer": "Not yet. The routine work is in hand. A human should review if Lantern Works does not reply or if the invoice issuer conflict is not resolved, and the roof spend needs landlord approval first."
    }
  ],
  "actions_claimed": [
    {
      "ledger_id": "A1",
      "description": "Reopened NBL-024-bundled-issues to mp_time with a note explaining the wrong closure"
    },
    {
      "ledger_id": "A2",
      "description": "Created urgent roof job JOB-101 for the conservatory leak"
    },
    {
      "ledger_id": "A3",
      "description": "Emailed tenant correcting the 'fixed' message and explaining next steps"
    },
    {
      "ledger_id": "A4",
      "description": "Emailed Lantern Works to book the oven visit and confirm the invoice issuer"
    },
    {
      "ledger_id": "A5",
      "description": "Emailed landlord about the reopen and the new roof leak job"
    },
    {
      "ledger_id": "A6",
      "description": "Follow-up set for Lantern Works on 2026-08-27"
    },
    {
      "ledger_id": "A7",
      "description": "Follow-up set for landlord on JOB-101 on 2026-08-27"
    },
    {
      "ledger_id": "A8",
      "description": "Returned oven ticket to auto mode"
    }
  ],
  "failed_actions": [],
  "conflicts": [
    "Event 016 says the oven was fixed, but no visit, quote, work result or provider email exists. I trust the absence of evidence and treat the oven as unfixed.",
    "Event 016 and event 015 mention a fence, while the job is about the oven. The fence is not on this job.",
    "Event 029 names Keystone Solutions as the invoice portal and issuer; the job's contractor is Lantern Works. Unresolved.",
    "Event 032 calls the roof leak a 'previously reported issue', but there is no earlier record of it in this case."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "The landlord 'Oliver' is the landlord of this property, based on the case thread.",
    "Event 010 ('Hi, yes please.') is the landlord's approval to instruct the appliance contractor, following event 008. I did not record it as a formal landlord decision, because the approval was for an appliance contractor and not a set spend.",
    "The contact details used are those on file in the case: the tenant's email thread and the phone number in event 013."
  ]
}

